<article class="env-exercise" id="028W">
  <p><a class="environment-identifier" href="/tag/028W">Exercise <span data-tag="028W">111.33.10</span>.</a> Give an example of a scheme $X$, a field $K$, and a morphism of ringed spaces $\mathop{\mathrm{Spec}}(K) \to X$ which is NOT a morphism of schemes. </p>
</article> 
